message: "If you use this workbook, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "AzureArcBRTips - Azure Arc Agent Version Compliance Workbook"
abstract: >-
  Azure Monitor workbook for Azure Arc-enabled servers, covering Connected
  Machine agent version compliance, estimated support status, automatic
  upgrade health, Azure Advisor, Azure Policy and extensions. Includes
  English and Brazilian Portuguese guides, an ARM deployment template
  and a PowerShell validation script.
